# Pairs with TypeOK. A policy change moves the snapshot outside the declared
# set of snapshots.
MODULE: PolicyLeavesDomain
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a policy change writes a snapshot outside Policies

--- FIND
    /\ policy' \in Policies \ {policy}
--- REPLACE
    /\ policy' \in (Policies \cup {"P3"}) \ {policy}
--- END
